<title>USA: Chic by H.I.S names Hadjigeorge CFO.</title>
<headline>Chic by H.I.S names Hadjigeorge CFO.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chic by H.I.S Inc said Wednesday it named Christine Hadjigeorge chief financial officer and treasurer.</p>
<p>She previously worked with clients in the apparel industry at the fashion group BBDO Seidman LLP.</p>
<p>Details on who Hadjigeorge replaced were not immediately available.</p>
